      "id": "node-hw-specs",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Key Hardware Numbers\n\n* **Frequency**: 13.56 MHz (NFC)\n* **Coil Inductance**: ~1.5 \u00b5H per coil\n* **Switches**: 74HC4067 multiplexers\n* **Wood Thickness**: Under 2.5mm\n* **Scan Speed**: Under 500ms for all 225 tiles\n* **Battery**: 3.7V 3000mAh + magnetic plug\n* **Turntable**: 250mm ball-bearing ring",
